## Details on Models

### Humanoid (Biped)
Use the standard Forge/Minecraft structure:
- `head`, `body`, `right_arm`, `left_arm`, `right_leg`, `left_leg`.
- Sync walking animations in `setupAnim`.

### Quadruped
- `body`, `leg1`, `leg2`, `leg3`, `leg4`, `head`.
- Standard walking logic.

